    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Karachi, 3rd Sept, 2005. \"Shoulder pain is a fairly common problem and affects the patient's daily activities and work. The two groups that suffer most from this problem are middle-aged or elderly patients and sportsmen.\" This was stated by Dr M.A. Wajid, Consultant Orthopaedic Surgeon, at 'Signs, Symptoms and Care', a health awareness programme held at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) on September 3, 2005 in Karachi.",
